edc8ce05de14.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1672145/54cf9a18-720c-499c-90cb-edc8ce05de14.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1672145/54cf9a18-720c-499c-90cb-edc8ce05de14.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Directly on the river Regen with views of the stunning Regensburg old city from your doorstep - this cosy one-room flat is newly renovated (completed November 2025) with a brand-new bathroom including an enclosed shower, professionally designed and installed kitchen and beautifully stylish floors.\n\nThe flat is fully furnished with everything you need for a highly comfortable short to medium-term stay. The smartly equipped and separated kitchen includes a microwave with a grill-function, a full-sized fridge and plenty of storage space. A convenient feature window can be used as a coffee station as well as enabling food to be served into the main room.\n\nThe main room includes a bed (140cm) with build-in drawers, a wardrobe, a wall-mounted Smart TV, a height-adjustable desk and a cosy reading nook.\n\n\nSituated in a vibrant neighborhood with its own cult indie cinema and local & international cuisine\nBy the junction of the Regen & Danube rivers, with scenic walking, running & cycling routes and a popular swimming spot at your doorstep\n5-min bike ride to Stadtamhof (highly popular restaurant & cafe strip) and the Old Stone Bridge leading to the city centre\n120m to the number 3 bus stop to Regensburg HBF\n400m to the nearest supermarket\n1 km from the Alex Center, featuring all essential stores and a library\n1.5 km from the Donau-Einkaufszentrum, a major shopping centre\nLess than 1 km to McFit Gym and other fitness/yoga studios\n700m from the MR offices\n","fac