 furnished room is available in a spacious shared apartment featuring a garden, large balcony, and a unique party room with a bar and fireplace.\nThis is a newly established shared apartment in an impressive owner-occupied property with approximately 200 m2 of living space.\nAre you looking for a quiet, spacious, and comfortable place to live during your studies? Then this is the perfect home for you.\nThe apartment, including all bedrooms, has been newly furnished and offers many high-quality amenities. Spread across approximately 200 m2, the apartment features five bright and spacious bedrooms, all in excellent condition. Freshly painted white walls and large windows create a bright and welcoming atmosphere while offering stunning views across Regensburg, including the city’s famous cathedral.\nThe modern kitchen was newly installed in 2021. Residents also benefit from two daylight bathrooms—one with a large bathtub and the other with a separate shower.\nThe kitchen and the spacious hallway serve as comfortable shared living areas.\nLooking for a place to relax or socialize? One of the apartment’s highlights is the 19 m2 lounge with a built-in bar and an open fireplace. It is perfect for spending evenings with friends or can be arranged to suit your own preferences.\nThe outdoor areas are equally impressive. A large balcony provides the perfect place to relax after a busy day or enjoy the sunshine. A newly installed awning offers pleasant shade during hot summer days. The garden is ideal for relaxing, gardening, or hosting a barbecue with your flatmates.\n\nRoom Features:\nThe room is rented fully furnished, and all utilities are included in the rent.\nEach room includes:\n\t●\ttwo 140 cm beds\n\t●\tBedside tables\n\t●\tLarge chest of drawers\n\t●\tClothes racks\n\t●\tDesks\n\t●\tOffice chairs\n\t●\tLamps\nA 250 Mbit/s high-speed internet connection is included in the monthly rent.\nThe shared kitchen is fully furnished and equipped with all essential cookware, dishes, and household utensils. A washing machine and tumble dryer are also available.\nThe spacious hallway offers built-in wardrobes, coat racks, seating areas, and a TV for shared use.\nAvailable Rooms\n\t●\tRoom 1 – 38.30 m2\n\t\nRental prices vary depending on the room.\nLocation:\nThe apartment is located in Brandlberg, one of Regensburg’s most popular residential areas.\nPublic Transport\nBrandlberg is very well connected to Regensburg’s public transportation network (RVV). Two bus stops are within easy walking distance, and Bus Line 4 provides a direct connection to the University of Regensburg.\nShopping\nThe Gewerbepark, ALEX-Center, and Donau Shopping Center are just a few minutes away and offer a wide range of shops, restaurants, and leisure facilities.\nA REWE supermarket and other everyday shopping options are within walking distance. Banks, schools, and kindergartens are also located nearby.\nLeisure\nBrandlberg is well known for its beautiful walking and cycling trails. From nearby viewpoints you can enjoy spectacular panoramic views over the entire city of Regensburg.\nRegensburg itself offers a rich cultural scene, numerous events throughout the year, and a charming UNESCO-listed Old Town with historic architecture, cafés, restaurants, and inviting public squares.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"shared"},"basement":{"value":"shared"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"38"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"carpet"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value